{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-13-9","kind":"proposition","title":"大小比较：黄金分割与六边形与十边形","englishTitle":"If the side of the hexagon and that of the decagon inscribed in the same circle be added together, the whole straight line has been cut in extreme and mean ratio, and its greater segment is the side of the hexagon.","book":13,"number":9,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.9","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.9/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":9,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-13-9@raw-4c83551db60d7700","contentId":"euclid-13-9","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4c83551db60d770035538b8fb42d7ba09e5f0a96c77eecf28ff25b43c6eacd25","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-13-9.statement","euclid-13-9.construction.1","euclid-13-9.construction.2","euclid-13-9.proof.1","euclid-13-9.proof.2","euclid-13-9.proof.3","euclid-13-9.proof.4","euclid-13-9.proof.5","euclid-13-9.proof.6","euclid-13-9.proof.7","euclid-13-9.proof.8","euclid-13-9.proof.9","euclid-13-9.proof.10","euclid-13-9.proof.11","euclid-13-9.conclusion","euclid-13-9.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-13-9.statement","contentId":"euclid-13-9","revisionId":"euclid-13-9@raw-4c83551db60d7700","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3cded7d03e9be1af0e256dacc729338386209762217a82ea9ed90c59057fd96b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If the side of the hexagon and that of the decagon inscribed in the same circle be added together, the whole straight line has been cut in extreme and mean ratio, and its greater segment is the side of the hexagon."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果将六边形和在同一圆内刻入的十边形的一面相加,整个直线在黄金分割就被剪切,其较大的部分是六边形的一面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-9.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-13-9","revisionId":"euclid-13-9@raw-4c83551db60d7700","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b0c80d8db650ba315cd5a30e63f5410404a79cc1613be1d026cfe77e004caa10","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABC be a circle; of the figures inscribed in the circle ABC let BC be the side of a decagon, CD that of a hexagon, and let them be in a straight line; I say that the whole straight line BD has been cut in extreme and mean ratio, and CD is its greater segment."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABC成为圆;在ABC圈中标注的数字中,BC是十角的一面,CD是六角的一面,让它们直线;我说,整个BD线在黄金分割被削减,CD是更大的部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-9.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-13-9","revisionId":"euclid-13-9@raw-4c83551db60d7700","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d8e61a3a7a3f889ddfa2457185512b5cf32fb371d4dc04a332bd1c8150010897","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the centre of the circle, the point E, be taken, let EB, EC, ED be joined, and let BE be carried through to A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将圆的中心,即E点,连接EB,EC,ED,BE,将BE带至A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-9.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-13-9","revisionId":"euclid-13-9@raw-4c83551db60d7700","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"307c5545f00de9d3072b777d0ccf7150b45a5cf5bcba620483a0ad133ad399e4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since BC is the side of an equilateral decagon, therefore the circumference ACB is five times the circumference BC; therefore the circumference AC is quadruple of CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于BC是等边形的一面,因此ACB环形是BC环形的五倍;因此,AC环形是CB的四倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-9.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-13-9","revisionId":"euclid-13-9@raw-4c83551db60d7700","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"54f083136aa9952a03c0407d8de78daf135ed12d0b828808ab5cfee8982e6640","citations":["euclid-6-33"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the circumference AC is to CB, so is the angle AEC to the angle CEB; [[VI. 33](/principles/euclid-6-33)] therefore the angle AEC is quadruple of the angle CEB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,环形AC比CB等于角度AEC比角度CEB;因此,角度AEC是角度CEB的四倍。 [[VI. 33](/principles/euclid-6-33)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-9.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-13-9","revisionId":"euclid-13-9@raw-4c83551db60d7700","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2f5e460e20873e2f895e3aa00e8451f89bf8e77be7fa1c9a22a6a884f116c262","citations":["euclid-1-5","euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the angle EBC is equal to the angle ECB, [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)] therefore the angle AEC is double of the angle ECB. [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于EBC角等于ECB角,AEC角是ECB角的两倍。 [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)] [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-9.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-13-9","revisionId":"euclid-13-9@raw-4c83551db60d7700","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b68d5b5410ed152e5323765d4cd8b0aaa92bff24cfec73f634f4ed85caf560f2","citations":["euclid-4-15","euclid-1-5","euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the straight line EC is equal to CD, for each of them is equal to the side of the hexagon inscribed in the circle ABC, [[IV. 15, Por.](/principles/euclid-4-15)] the angle CED is also equal to the angle CDE; [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)] therefore the angle ECB is double of the angle EDC. [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于EC线等于CD, 每一个线等于ABC圆内所标六边形的一面, CED角也等于CDE角; 因此, ECB角是EDC角的两倍。 [[IV. 15, Por.](/principles/euclid-4-15)] [[I. 5](/principles/euclid-1-5)] [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-9.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-13-9","revisionId":"euclid-13-9@raw-4c83551db60d7700","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bcd1d6ce99f4c4bb741e7881647db7711b759654b7e71deaec6c00722cb20171","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle AEC was proved double of the angle ECB; therefore the angle AEC is quadruple of the angle EDC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AEC角被证明是ECB角的两倍,因此AEC角是EDC角的四倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-9.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-13-9","revisionId":"euclid-13-9@raw-4c83551db60d7700","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fe0bafffee0a4795c2afceb5c404669f410f45fa85a87d234eb3a94ad9248e5a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle AEC was also proved quadruple of the angle BEC; therefore the angle EDC is equal to the angle BEC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但AEC角度也证明是BEC角度的四倍;因此,EDC角度等于BEC角度。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-9.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-13-9","revisionId":"euclid-13-9@raw-4c83551db60d7700","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7754efcb124ca2782f862f57c2398f091fe64c6905620185ad025f867149e273","citations":["euclid-1-32"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle EBD is common to the two triangles BEC and BED; therefore the remaining angle BED is also equal to the remaining angle ECB; [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)] therefore the triangle EBD is equiangular with the triangle EBC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EBD角是两个三角形的常见角度,即BEC和BED角;因此,其余的BED角也等于其余角度ECB;因此,EBD三角形与EBC三角形为等角。 [[I. 32](/principles/euclid-1-32)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-9.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-13-9","revisionId":"euclid-13-9@raw-4c83551db60d7700","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0a9b16b4cf47941f376b29f4c93038e59c5a5758515413189d4fa2dd60f2a52f","citations":["euclid-6-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, proportionally, as DB is to BE, so is EB to BC. [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DB比BE的比例相当于EB比BC；DB 与 BE 之比等于 EB 与 BC 之比。 [[VI. 4](/principles/euclid-6-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-9.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-13-9","revisionId":"euclid-13-9@raw-4c83551db60d7700","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b4606f25b3f7f3ffefb8c13d7fb6cad4648ebf891f2c9e43342a01c08e88f04","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But EB is equal to CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但EB等于CD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-9.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-13-9","revisionId":"euclid-13-9@raw-4c83551db60d7700","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"358e3d3781a721aa97fb6c38db026438603d5d586db6b2146635ec2fc0ccfbe5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as BD is to DC, so is DC to CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BD对DC的比等于DC对CB的比；BD 与 DC 之比等于 DC 与 CB 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-9.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-13-9","revisionId":"euclid-13-9@raw-4c83551db60d7700","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"22f7060cea485b9a6c39dea184184148f1e6eca3dd0cac50a991f689d50192e6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And BD is greater than DC; therefore DC is also greater than CB."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"BD比DC强,DC也大于CB。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-9.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-13-9","revisionId":"euclid-13-9@raw-4c83551db60d7700","order":14,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"51c29070a54441e665c62948da021e8531356c0edeeaa9c95302aad1df9d3454","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the straight line BD has been cut in extreme and mean ratio, and DC is its greater segment. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,直线 BD在黄金分割被削减,第DC是其较大的部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-9.source","contentId":"euclid-13-9","revisionId":"euclid-13-9@raw-4c83551db60d7700","order":15,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"52450c18a261d99f91abe631093244ec6cda7f22f69e027eba9fa8dac7cad040","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.9/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.9\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-9:euclid-6-33:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-9.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-33","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"VI. 33"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-9:euclid-1-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-9.proof.3","euclid-13-9.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"I. 5"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-9:euclid-1-32:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-9.proof.3","euclid-13-9.proof.4","euclid-13-9.proof.7"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-32","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"I. 32"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-9:euclid-4-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-9.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-4-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"IV. 15, Por."}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-9:euclid-6-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-9.proof.8"],"targetContentId":"euclid-6-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.9/","sourceLabel":"VI. 4"}}],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-16:euclid-13-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-16","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-16.proof.28"],"targetContentId":"euclid-13-9","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.16","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.16/","sourceLabel":"XIII. 9"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-13-18:euclid-13-9:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-18","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-18.proof.37"],"targetContentId":"euclid-13-9","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.18","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.18/","sourceLabel":"XIII. 9"}}],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-9:euclid-6-33:explicit","id":"euclid-6-33","book":6,"number":33,"kind":"proposition","title":"等圆之乘圆分角或在心或在界其各相当两乘圆角之比例皆若所乘两